<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Eisai raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Eisai raised.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd said on Friday that it had upgraded Eisai Co Ltd to a &quot;1&quot; from its previous &quot;2&quot;.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, Nomura assigns a &quot;1&quot; rating to issues whosee values it expects will outperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
